Description: Wireless CarPlay receiver for rootful jailbreaks.
 Showcase turns a jailbroken iPhone or iPad into a wireless CarPlay
 receiver. This package uses the rootful layout and supports iOS 12 or newer.
 .
 Beta 4 brings cleaner screens, a tappable sound picker and automatic
 Personal Hotspot.
